    ["占卜画面中出现了三个人，一位戴着兜帽的神秘女子、一位长相俊秀的少年和刚刚逃走的特莉丝，我总觉得自己见过其中的两位。"] = "Three people appeared in the divination image: a mysterious woman in a hood, a handsome young man, and Trissy who just escaped. I always feel like I've seen two of them before.",
