    ["嗯，这是它的名字。很久很久以前，美丽的村落被恶龙袭击，木马骑士在那场灾难里失去了他最爱的姐姐，于是他决定成为一名骑士，向恶龙复仇。"] = "Hmm, that is its name. A long, long time ago, a beautiful village was assaulted by a dragon. The Wooden Horse Knight lost his beloved sister in that disaster, so he decided to become a knight and take revenge on the dragon.",
