    ["城市的暗面见证了新的传奇：{{player.name}} 挑战<Chat_Highlight>“审判官”布莱克</>的所用时长已跻身历史前十。时间为之折服，让我们恭喜新的传说就此诞生。"] = "The dark side of the city has witnessed a new legend: {{player.name}}'s time taken to challenge <Chat_Highlight>\"Blake, the Judge\"</> has reached the top ten in history. Time has been conquered by it; let us congratulate the birth of a new legend.",
