    ["屏障消失了，想办法靠近绝望魔镜！"] = "The barrier has disappeared, find a way to get close to the Magic Mirror of Despair!",
    ["弗莱并不是一个话多的人，也不喜欢凑热闹，连爱好也是待在角落安静地画画。\n他曾经梦想成为一位画家，过一种安稳平凡的生活。\n不过后来，他听从家人的建议，成为了一位体面的牧师，做得还不赖。\n再后来，他加入了黑荆棘，成为了序列9的收尸人。\n明明也算充满波澜的人生，但在他的叙述中，这一切平淡得像一杯温水——或者说，冷水。\n\n作为一名“收尸人”，他皮肤苍白，气质阴冷，少言少笑，日常工作是和尸体打交道，天然难让人产生亲近感，但相处久了才知道，他会在克莱恩害怕尸体的时候，默默给他练习的机会；他会在伦纳德迟到的时候，帮他打掩护；他会在任务结束后，默默帮队友善后。\n他很少说什么，但每次有人需要帮助的时候，他永远在。\n\n这个想法一直延续到弗莱成为队长后。\n“我想留在黑荆棘，一直保护这里。”\n就这样，他拒绝了继续晋升，拒绝了远行，选择留在熟悉的佐特兰街36号，除了日常出任务外，偶尔还会画几张画。\n在他的画里，所有离开的人都不曾离开，并且各自有一个不错的结局：邓恩队长终于鼓起勇气向戴莉女士告白，老尼尔与恋人为他们弹琴祝贺，克莱恩完成了一个非常赚钱的委托，伦纳德写出了人生中第一首诗，洛耀西迦科恩黎罗珊在研究一种新的四人方块牌，据说也来自罗塞尔大帝，叫什么斗麻雀……\n而他弗莱，则在角落里，安静地画着这些瞬间。\n在这个疯狂的世界里，不是每个人都想要成为传奇，有的人只是想守着一方天地，静静度过每一天。"] = "Frye is not a talkative person, nor does he like to join in the fun; even his hobby is staying in a corner and painting quietly. \n He once dreamed of becoming a painter and living a stable and ordinary life. \n But later, he followed his family's advice and became a decent priest, and he wasn't bad at it. \n Later still, he joined Blackthorn and became a Sequence 9 Corpse Collector. \n Although it could be considered a life full of ups and downs, in his narration, everything was as plain as a cup of warm water—or rather, cold water. \n \n As a \"Corpse Collector,\" he is pale, cold, and quiet. His daily work involves dealing with corpses, which naturally makes it hard for people to feel close to him. But after spending time with him, you realize that when Klein is afraid of corpses, he silently gives him opportunities to practice; when Leonard is late, he helps him cover; and after a mission, he silently helps his teammates clean up. \n He rarely says anything, but whenever someone needs help, he is always there. \n \n This thought continued until Frye became captain. \n \"I want to stay at Blackthorn and always protect this place.\" \n Just like that, he refused further promotion, refused to travel far, and chose to stay at 36 Zoutland Street. Besides his daily missions, he would occasionally paint a few pictures. \n In his paintings, all those who left never really left, and each had a good ending: Captain Dunn finally gathered the courage to confess to Ms. Daly, Old Neil played the piano for them with his lover, Klein completed a very profitable commission, Leonard wrote the first poem of his life, and Luo Yao, Xiga, Cohen, and Rosanne were studying a new four-person block game, which was said to also come from Emperor Roselle and was called something like Mahjong... \n And he, Frye, was in the corner, quietly painting these moments. \n In this crazy world, not everyone wants to be a legend; some people just want to guard a piece of heaven and earth and spend every day quietly.",
